      "releaseNotes": "A new look: your child is drawn in what to wear, in today's weather.\n\nHeading out? See what to change while you're out, what to bring for later, and when to put sun cream on and top it up. You'll get a reminder at each change.\n\nTonight's room: once it has learnt how your bedroom follows the weather, Tots Weather forecasts the room at bedtime and the sleeping bag to match.\n\nToday: tap any piece of clothing to see what goes under it, or tap an hour to see what they'll need later.\n\nPlan: tomorrow's clothes to lay out tonight, your morning briefing and trips.",
